# 23. BACKEND VALIDATION AND TOOL EXECUTION

All operational actions are executed by the backend.

The reasoning model cannot execute arbitrary application tools.

Every proposed extraction or operation must pass:

1. Pydantic schema validation.
2. Session ownership validation.
3. Incident ownership validation.
4. Session state validation.
5. Permission validation.
6. Source provenance validation.
7. Idempotency validation.
8. Backend policy validation.

Every LLM-extracted fact must contain a valid source_utterance_id.

Never weaken this requirement to "where applicable."

