## 28.2 Classification and provenance tests

- Every supported emergency category.
- Valid unknown classification.
- Ambiguous classification.
- First consecutive unknown result.
- Second consecutive unknown result.
- Unknown fallback after exactly two failed classifications.
- No fallback after only one unknown result.
- Supported category resets the counter.
- Yes/no answers do not increment the counter.
- Numeric answers do not increment the counter.
- Acknowledgment utterances do not increment the counter.
- utterance_role other than new_description never increments the counter.
- Missing or invalid utterance_role is treated as schema-invalid.
- Dialogue context is passed to the classification request.
